# History Is Immutable

Any historical record (audit, health, location, transactions) is never edited or removed.

- Corrections are made by **new records** that reference the corrected record
- Audit logs cover every write: who, when, what, before and after
- Audit data has a defined retention policy that is enforced

## Implementation Guidance

- Prefer append-only storage for audit trails
- Use soft-delete only when legally required; prefer anonymization over deletion
- Expose history as a read-only query surface
